      "id": "claim_a995b4b531c44e299a821b3513086a3f",
      "statement": "dsh-tools provides ctx.tools, the registry tool plugins register into and the loop dispatches through: every model tool call runs through a guarded pipeline (allow/deny/ask policy, monotonic guards, around-dispatch wrappers, result inspection, definition-owned content finalization, and a final observe-only notification), its mode config selects native function calling, PTC mode, catalog mode, or both, and tool authors use defineTool for typed parameter and output schemas.",
